{"id":"9f85049d19d671c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-homeomorphism-type.md","title":"Homeomorphism Type","display":"df-homeomorphism-type — Homeomorphism Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-homeomorphism-type","aliases":["58-df-homeomorphism-type"],"display":"df-homeomorphism-type — Homeomorphism Type","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-injective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-homeomorphism-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-homeomorphism-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homeomorphism-type — Homeomorphism Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"58-df-injective\">58-df-injective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathscr T,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathscr T,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (injective-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"58-df-injective\">58-df-injective</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\;\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\;\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (homeomorphism relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\in V\">\\([\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\in V\\)</span> (relative homeomorphism-type set defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X\\;(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X\\;(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(f[U]\\in\\tau_Y)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(f[U]\\in\\tau_Y)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relative} \\vdash [\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal Y\\in\\mathscr T:\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\land\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal Y)\\land\\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relative} \\vdash [\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal Y\\in\\mathscr T:\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\land\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal Y)\\land\\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relative class is a set because the ambient collection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathscr T\\)</span> is a set.</li>\n<li>Without a set-sized ambient collection (or a canonical-representative convention), all set codes homeomorphic to a fixed nonempty space form a proper class rather than a ZFC set.</li>\n<li>Surjectivity, injectivity, inverse-image continuity, and openness are all checked against the carriers and topologies stored in the two codes; no topology is existentially replaced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (topological-space predicate, see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (injective-function predicate, see [[58-df-injective]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y,\\mathscr T,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\;\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"[\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X\\;(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\tau_X\\rangle\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\tau_Y\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(f)=Y\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\tau_Y\\;(f^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau_X)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau_X\\;(f[U]\\in\\tau_Y)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\operatorname{HomeoCode}_S(f,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homeomorphism\\text{-}type\\text{-}relative} \\vdash [\\mathcal X]_{\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}}^{\\mathscr T}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal Y\\in\\mathscr T:\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal X)\\land\\operatorname{TopSpaceCode}_S(\\mathcal Y)\\land\\mathcal X\\cong_{\\mathrm{top}}\\mathcal Y\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr T","display":false}],"bytes":2716,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-634","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-homeomorphism-type.md|58-df-homeomorphism-type]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751","8317eefb4572709e"]}